<title>USA: Barrett Resources names Paul Rady as CEO.</title>
<headline>Barrett Resources names Paul Rady as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrett Resources Corp said Monday it had named Paul Rady as chief executive officer, effective July 1.</p>
<p>Rady, 43, succeeds William Barrett, 68, who will continue as chairman, the company said.</p>
<p>Rady joined Barrett Resources in August 1990 and has been president, chief operating officer and a director of the company since September 1994.</p>
<p>He will retain the title of president, the company said.</p>
</text>
